[98.87067, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[?25l\u001b[90mLOCAL AI AGENT HARNESS  /  v0.1.0  /  REAL CLI RECORDING\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[96m06  Disable the plugin. The tools disappear.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mThe host is unchanged: plugin lifecycle controls which capabilities the model receives.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
